# Decision Decay Skill

When the user asks "is this still right", "revisit", "should we reconsider", "has anything changed", "decision review", or "decay check":

1. Read `skills/decision-decay/SKILL.md`
2. Identify the decision being reviewed
3. Extract the assumptions that made it correct at the time
4. Check each assumption against current reality
5. Score the decay: Fresh / Aging / Stale
6. If Aging or Stale: present the case for reconsidering AND the case for staying — sunk cost is never valid, switching cost is
